# Soulstone Sanctuary: "{4}: This land becomes a 3/3 creature with vigilance and all creature types. It's still a land."
# Played on turn 1, it is a plain Land on turn 3 until Bot1 pays {4} (Sol Ring, Mox Jet and a Swamp). Then it is a Land
# Creature (CR 205.1b) with every creature type (CR 205.3m, layer 4), a 3/3 (layer 7b) with vigilance (layer 6) and no
# Changeling (the Mutavault ruling: all creature types is not the keyword), still colorless, as the text names no color.
# It attacks, untapped by vigilance. The ability has no duration (CR 611.2a, the card's ruling), so on Bot2's turn 4,
# after a cleanup step that ends "until end of turn" effects, it is still all of that.

[Bot1 Deck]
Soulstone Sanctuary
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Swamp
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

